Description: Give the default-context provider a Debian-tracked ABI SONAME
 The provider exports the versioned v1 context API and is a dedicated shared
 owner.  Set the CMake target version/SOVERSION so Debian can split the
 runtime provider from the development headers and let dh_makeshlibs track
 the ABI instead of shipping an unversioned shared object.
Forwarded: not-needed
Author: octave-mplapack packaging team <noreply@example.invalid>
Last-Update: 2026-09-20

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -248,4 +248,6 @@
 set_target_properties(gmpxx_mkII_default_context_provider PROPERTIES
     EXPORT_NAME default_context_provider
+    VERSION ${PROJECT_VERSION}
+    SOVERSION 1
 )
 add_library(gmpxx_mkII::default_context_provider ALIAS gmpxx_mkII_default_context_provider)
